e": "screen01.png", "id": "686837029678994", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035354_686837033012327_5993127014333897630_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XnzBy2pnTsIQ7kNvwEkLcY9&_nc_oc=AdpMdhM51AFloa714LYHHvsZFPxK6tVMl28ZoTCPIcoidSqfTOVHeInBdCb3uYYjKd8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQaw5Sum1eZLkGsgBJOOxvLN9jR0halHSqydYt6j5ZF-g&oe=6AFC83A5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Meta&TAFE_Anatomy_icon_2560x1440.png", "id": "816247259438010", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001702_816247262771343_7938637194561121858_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qY2EwEagnOAQ7kNvwH5IW3A&_nc_oc=AdrWN4DkUV3YmtQd7w5swVpdET065kSe6r1oGqg5wmyr8Q56UYYEN0w94jdbodwPqPs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRSLR-NtfBafyOa9ZF0Du4XqBXoSTFupaiSJ6eR3rRqUw&oe=6AFC8853"}, "display_name": "Animal Anatomy Explorer", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo.\n\nThe experience also features an interactive quiz, which assesses the player\u2019s knowledge of the anatomy of said animal. Players are given feedback on the quiz in real-time and can learn through repetition as the questions in the quiz randomize each time it is taken. ", "short_description": "Animal Anatomy is a standalone experience that allows players to learn about animal anatomy through open exploration of an anatomically accurate, multi-layered digital replica of animals. In this initial release, two mammals will be included, a dog and a bison/buffalo."}]}, "developer_name": "TAFE NSW", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.tafensw.edu.au